Shapefile Field Descriptions
Notes:
These fields correspond to the attributes in the shapefile.
Abbreviated names were used to comply with field length limitations in shapefiles.
The geometry field represents the spatial data, storing the geographical boundaries or shapes of each country.

| Abbreviated Field Name      |    Full Description                                |
|-----------------------------|----------------------------------------------------|
| **Alpha3code**              | Alpha-3 Code (ISO country code)                    |
| **fid**                     | Feature ID                                         |
| **FORMAL_EN**               | Formal English Name of the Country                 |
| **ECONOMY**                 | Economy Classification                             |
| **INCOME_GRP**              | Income Group Classification                        |
| **WB_A3**                   | World Bank Alpha-3 Code                            |
| **CONTINENT**               | Continent                                          |
| **SUBREGION**               | Subregion                                          |
| **ryg_trend**               | Relative Yield Gap Trend                           |
| **avg_yg**                  | Average Weighted Yield Gap                         |
| **shann_avg**               | Shannon Index (main crops)                         |
| **shann_avg_grp**           | Shannon Index (functional groups main crops)       |
| **shann_all**               | Shannon Index (All Crops)                          |
| **shann_grp_all**           | Shannon Index (Functional groups All Crops)        |
| **pct_cult_area**           | Percent of Total Country Area Cultivated           |
| **Tot_land_cv**             | Total Land Cover                                   |
| **prp_main_hrv**            | Dominance of the major crops in harvested area     |
| **ecor**                    | Shannon Index (Ecoregions)                         |
| **pct_irrig**               | Percent of Cultivated Area Equipped for Irrigation |
| **roads_km2**               | Road Density (km²)                                 |
| **Avg_pest**                | Pesticide Use                                      |
| **fert_avg**                | Fertilizer Use                                     |
| **GDP_percap**              | GDP per Capita                                     |
| **Agr_GDP**                 | Percent Agriculture Value Added to GDP             |
| **Ind_GDP**                 | Percent Industry Value Added to GDP                |
| **Srv_GDP**                 | Percent Service Value Added to GDP                 |
| **Pop_dens**                | Population Density                                 |
| **pct_rural**               | Percent of Rural Population                        |
| **HDI**                     | Human Development Index                            |
| **CV_NRI**                  | Coefficient of Variation of National Rainfall Index|
| **cv_temp**                 | Coefficient of Variation of Temperature            |
| **Acctblty**                | Voice and Accountability                           |
| **law**                     | Rule of Law                                        |
| **rgltn**                   | Regulatory Quality                                 |
| **pltcl_stab**              | Political Stability and Absence of Violence        |
| **effect**                  | Government Effectiveness                           |
| **corrpt**                  | Control of Corruption                              |
| **GII**                     | Gender Inequality Index                            |
| **dmcrcy**                  | Average Democracy Index                            |
| **areakm**                  | Area (km²)                                         |
| **geometry**                | Geometrical Shape (Spatial Data)                   |

